  <p id="c-chenshu-004-yuanshu-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吏部尚書<persName id="c-chenshu-004-yuanshu-death:p001:m0004" ref="hb9_2gq_205_AA">袁樞</persName>為尚書左僕射；</p>
